  "details": "It gets irritating to open the Steam VR menu to check the time or date, especially when half the time Steam VR will begin to lag your VR Experience. This could easily be fixed by adding g a system clock next to the build number in your hand menus as well as the date. This could also integrate alarms, reminders, and even calendar reminders, such as reminding you an hour before you have work (This is an example.) I think this would be a very good addition to VRChat.",
